      "value": "Personally, I have a feeling that the ratio of favorites to visits is one of the factors used when deciding whether a world is promoted from Community Labs to Public. Because of that, I'm also concerned that this could affect Public promotion. (I'm worried that worlds which would normally make it to Public might no longer be promoted.)",
