      "mergedPostDetails": "Recently, the recorded visitor counts for worlds have started rising much quicker than they used to. I suspect there was a shift somewhere around June 16th.\n\nTo give an example, a third-party website reported the following visitor numbers for The Black Cat before and after this date:\n\n06.06. - 13.06.\n\n411748\n\n29.06. - 06.07.\n\n760359\n\nI have observed a similar spike of reported visitor numbers for my own world, yet the average number of people in instances remained the same during both time periods.\n\nThis makes me believe that something about the counting of visitors has changed.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Unusually High Visitor Count for Worlds",
